---
title: Batanes Niche – Authentication Workflow (JWT + OTP)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User (Browser)
    participant SPA as React SPA<br/>(AuthContext)
    participant API as Express.js<br/>/api/v1/auth
    participant AUS as AuthService
    participant DB as Database
    participant SMTP as SMTP Server

    Note over User,SMTP: === Standard Login Flow ===
    User->>SPA: Enter username + password
    SPA->>API: POST /auth/login (loginLimiter: 5 req/60s)
    API->>AUS: authenticateUser(credentials)
    AUS->>DB: SELECT user WHERE username=? AND status=active
    DB-->>AUS: User record
    AUS->>AUS: bcrypt.compare(password, password_hash)
    AUS->>DB: INSERT refresh_token (SHA-256 hash, 7d TTL)
    AUS-->>API: { access_token (JWT 15min), refresh_token }
    API-->>SPA: 200 { access_token, refresh_token }
    SPA->>SPA: Store access_token in memory<br/>Store refresh_token (HttpOnly-like)

    Note over User,SMTP: === Silent Token Refresh (Axios Interceptor) ===
    SPA->>API: Any API call with expired access token
    API-->>SPA: 401 Unauthorized
    SPA->>API: POST /auth/refresh { refresh_token }
    API->>AUS: rotateRefreshToken(refresh_token)
    AUS->>DB: SELECT refresh_token WHERE hash=? AND NOT revoked
    AUS->>DB: UPDATE old token → revoked=true
    AUS->>DB: INSERT new refresh_token (rotation)
    AUS-->>API: { new access_token, new refresh_token }
    API-->>SPA: 200 { access_token, refresh_token }
    SPA->>SPA: Update in-memory token, retry original request

    Note over User,SMTP: === OTP Password Reset Flow ===
    User->>SPA: Request password reset (email)
    SPA->>API: POST /auth/forgot-password (3 req/60s limit)
    API->>AUS: requestPasswordReset(email)
    AUS->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email=?
    AUS->>AUS: crypto.randomInt(100000,1000000) → 6-digit OTP
    AUS->>AUS: bcrypt.hash(otp, 10) → otp_hash
    AUS->>DB: INSERT password_reset_tokens (otp_hash, 15min TTL)
    AUS->>SMTP: sendOtpEmail(email, otp_code)
    SMTP-->>User: Email with 6-digit OTP
    API-->>SPA: 200 { message: "If account exists..." }
    User->>SPA: Enter OTP + new password
    SPA->>API: POST /auth/reset-password { email, otp_code, new_password }
    API->>AUS: resetPassword(email, otp, new_password)
    AUS->>DB: SELECT token WHERE identifier=email AND NOT used
    AUS->>AUS: bcrypt.compare(otp, otp_hash) + check expiry + attempts
    AUS->>AUS: bcrypt.hash(new_password, 12)
    AUS->>DB: UPDATE user password_hash
    AUS->>DB: UPDATE reset_token used=true
    AUS->>DB: Revoke all refresh_tokens for user
    API-->>SPA: 200 { message: "Password reset successful" }
